<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS TIMETABLE FOR AUGUST 2.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS TIMETABLE FOR AUGUST 2.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Timetable of events for the first</p>
<p>day of competition at the world athletics championships starting</p>
<p>on Saturday (all time GMT):</p>
<p>0500 - Men's hammer qualifying round, group A</p>
<p>0510 - Women's 400 metres first round</p>
<p>0520 - Women's triple jump qualifying round, two groups</p>
<p>0550 - Men's shot put qualifying round, two groups</p>
<p>0600 - Women's 1,500 metres first round</p>
<p>0630 - Women's 100 metres first round</p>
<p>0700 - Men's hammer qualifying group B</p>
<p>0730 - Men's 100 metres first round</p>
<p>1500 - Men's 400 metres hurdles first round</p>
<p>1550 - Men's 100 metres second round</p>
<p>1610 - Men's shot put final</p>
<p>1620 - Men's 20 kilometres walk (start)</p>
<p>1635 - Women's 100 metres second round</p>
<p>1655 - Women's 400 metres second round</p>
<p>1735 - Men's 20-km walk (finish)</p>
<p>1750 - Women's 10,000 metres first round</p>
</text>
